# Parametric links and relink (an extension): a plate with a parameter
# L and the configurations short and long is linked into an empty model.
# Its group screen regenerates it in "long", then passes L the value 60;
# Analyze > Measure Volume gives 60 x 30 x 10. [relink] points the link
# at a block instead, which has no parameters, as the screen and the
# file show.
file $testdata/linkparams/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/linkparams/plate.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
tw
twmove 366 170
twdown L 366 170
twup L 366 170
tw
twmove 258 190
twdown L 258 190
twup L 258 190
edit 60
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Measure Volume
file $testdata/linkparams/block.tlspr
twmove 186 130
twdown L 186 130
twup L 186 130
tw
save
